WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.300
<v><b>Expert:</b></v> I think your friend has been a bit insensitive,

00:00:03.596 --> 00:00:05.635
and she’s put you in a difficult position.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.109
You have several different options.

00:00:08.364 --> 00:00:11.313
You could say that you aren’t going if Angie goes,

00:00:11.684 --> 00:00:13.964
but then you’ll put Susan in a difficult position.

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:19.448
Or you could just cancel, and suggest having another holiday later, with just the two of you.

00:00:19.866 --> 00:00:24.514
Or you could invite someone else who you like, and then there would be four of you,

00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:27.375
which is sometimes a better number than three.

00:00:27.581 --> 00:00:31.970
But in fact, you don’t know Angie, and maybe you’ll like her.

00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:35.706
So I think you should try to get to know her first.

00:00:36.301 --> 00:00:39.711
If you like her, then the holiday will probably be a success.

00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:46.085
If not, then you should tell your friend you aren’t going because you don’t think it will work with Angie.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:50.415
You know, a bad holiday is worse than no holiday

00:00:50.825 --> 00:00:54.633
<v><b>Jane:</b></v> Yes, that’s absolutely true. Thanks a lot.